    {
      "id": "claim_1c4ddedda32143ee83589450c794ddcc",
      "statement": "DOL Release 2026-31 P.3 removes the minimum required contribution for a plan above 110% funded under P.2 and allows the sponsor to elect to treat the excess as available for P.4 purposes; P.4 limits those uses to a qualified replacement-plan transfer or retiree health accounts and does not authorize a sponsor reversion outside the existing statutory framework.",
      "evidence": [
